.TH CANON-SCAN-TO-PC-SETTINGS 1 "2026" "canon-scan-to-pc" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
canon-scan-to-pc-settings \- settings window for canon-scan-to-pc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B canon-scan-to-pc-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
A GTK window to choose the printer, the name shown on it, where scans are saved, the file
format, resolution, paper size and source, and whether the service starts at login. It
shows the service's status and the last scan, and can run a test scan. Save writes
\fI~/.config/canon-scan-to-pc/config.ini\fR and restarts the service.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR canon-scan-to-pc (1)
